# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Commentator Analysis Tool — config template
#
# This is a vanilla HTML/JS tool. It currently hardcodes an
# OpenRouter API key in `app.js`. For production, move the key to a
# backend proxy (e.g. a Supabase edge function in the unified
# project) and read it from there — NEVER ship a real key in the
# browser bundle.
#
# The variables below are only meaningful when you add a
# backend-proxy layer. Replace `config.js` with a small loader that
# reads them at deploy time, or inject them via the hosting
# provider's build env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

